+      SAVE A, P, SIG, SEG, ITT, SITO, PLAB, ALP, BET, STOT, REA
+      DATA A/9.D0,12.D0,27.D0,47.9D0,55.9D0,63.5D0,112.4D0,
+     &207.2D0,238.1D0/
